{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261111/photo/bkn-20261111051439356-1111_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261111072402\"/><p>傷者清醒送院救治。</p><p>粉嶺發生工業意外，現場在安樂門街，今日(11日)凌晨1時56分， 一名姓楊(52歲)男子在一輛輕型貨車工作期間，意外從約1米高墮下受傷，其同事發現報案求助。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，楊男頭部受傷，清醒被送往北區醫院治理。經初步調查，案件列「工業意外—有人意外受傷」跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T23:49:11.249543+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T21:14:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T00:43:12.941701+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T23:42:45.427911+00:00","content_hash":"fc90ff7301bb68e1c3d640e04a1d3163bf58695fd5a46979b612bbae3b58d0ef","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}